  "message": "The change in the product warranty reserve from 2005 to 2006 can be explained by the reserve roll-forward: beginning reserve of $4 million in 2005, plus 2006 pretax warranty charges of $4 million, plus $7 million of warranty obligations assumed in 2006 acquisitions, minus 2006 cash outlays of $5 million. The net change is therefore 4 + 7 - 5 = 6 million USD.",
